{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41389","headline":"陪华林园试小妓羯鼓 · 宋齐丘","name":"陪华林园试小妓羯鼓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"切断牙牀镂紫金，最宜平稳玉槽深。\n因逢淑景开佳宴，爲出花奴奏雅音。\n掌底轻璁孤鹊噪，枝头乾快乱蝉吟。\n开元天子曾如此，今日将军好用心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋齐丘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}